 "integration": {
  "summary": "Connect the TV-WSHP to the BACnet IP network (or through a TV-CRB-E2 router for MS/TP), set Occupancy Source to BAS On/Off if the BMS should drive occupancy, then write MV 1001 and the occupied setpoints. Read System Mode, controlling temperature, fan and compressor status and the alarm BVs.",
  "minimum_points": [
   {
